<title>FINLAND: METSALIITTO FINANCING COMPANY TO START NEXT YEAR.</title>
<headline>METSALIITTO FINANCING COMPANY TO START NEXT YEAR.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish forest industry cooperative Metsaliitto-Yhtyma, parent of Metsa-Serla Oy, said in a statement on Monday it was setting up a separate financing company at the start of May next year.</p>
<p>It said that it expected concentrating all financial issues to one company would cut costs and bring other benefits.</p>
<p>The financing company which will serve Metsaliitto cooperative Metsa-Serla, Finnforest and Metsa Timber will possess the entire group's expertise and experience in finance, Metsaliitto said.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom + 358 - 0 - 680 50 240</p>
</text>
